SOLUTION 1
    temp 20
    pH 8 charge
    C(4) 0.05 mol/kgw as C

SOLUTION 2
    temp 20
    pH 8 charge
    Ca 0.05 mol/kgw

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10 steps

SELECTED_OUTPUT 1
    -reset false
    -temperature true
    -ionic_strength true
    -step true

END
